{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_079_1000_045kar", "source_sha256": "8ed2239df1eff37560abace62186a76fdfc4bd416185b0946036159e9e76e12c", "ja": "うう…真さん、ごめんなさい…。\nダンスレッスン、わ、私のミスで\n全然進まなくて…迷惑でしたよね？", "zh": "呜呜……真，对不起……\n舞蹈练习，因、因为我的失误\n完全没法推进……给你添麻烦了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_079_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "ba2da39a5c206109c2d9f2f7d98d216a3c7e213085e1476674ab05d79b1b88db", "ja": "そんなことないよ！\n難しいステップだったもんね。\nこれって、動きにコツがあるんだ！", "zh": "才不是那样呢！\n毕竟是很难的舞步嘛。\n这个动作是有窍门的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_079_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "289e78593d5768f1a6145ed2fef305c1f62b8fe1dbe75e363119d475dc62e912", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか？\n私も、そこがうまくできなくて…。\nぜひ、教えてください！", "zh": "真、真的吗？\n我也总是做不好那里……\n请务必教教我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_079_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "1472d8775b5cdcd5ec9a6a3415dcc66f06ec5acbb1123a620681be23a51ac487", "ja": "うん！　まず右足を踏み込んだら、\n左足を、シュバッ！　って\nしならせる感じで……。", "zh": "嗯！首先右脚踩进去之后，\n左脚要像“唰！”那样\n带着弹性甩出去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_079_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "bc0f3ee073f305eeba33f49899db91be32b963c718281d53f7569871b418c1c5", "ja": "左足を、シュバッ…？\nですか？　えーっと……。", "zh": "左腿……咻的一下？\n是这样吗？那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_079_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "3d22c83ea2b0a58a9179a3dd34c1f0159e6aa1e62efaebfa21c2739ef67518c9", "ja": "うーん、なんて言ったらいいの\nかな……。こう、グルッ！\nショパッ！　って感じで……。", "zh": "嗯……该怎么说才好呢……就是，像这样，咕噜！\n唰啪！的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
